       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.

       PROGRAM-ID.     CPORMVUSR.
       AUTHOR.         EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH
      ***************************************************************
      **                     C P O R M V U S R
      ***************************************************************
      ** THIS PROGRAM DELETES RECORDS FROM MCFPPOTRG BASED ON PARMS
      ** PASSED FROM THE CALLER. THE PARMS ARE:
      **    1) USER   2) JOB  3) JOB NUMBER  4) MODE = 1 OR 2
      **
      ** WHEN THE MODE = "1" A SINGLE RECORD IS RETRIEVED AND DELETED
      ** USING THE PASSED KEY VALUES OF USER/JOB/JNBR.
      **
      ** WHEN THE MODE = "2" THE USER FIELD IS USED TO LOOP THRU THE
      ** FILE LOOKING FOR "INACTIVE" USER/***/**** RECORDS.
      ***************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************

      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   APRIL 01 2003      DAN RAUCH
      *   INITIAL AUTHOR   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *   MONTH DD CCYY      XXXXXXXXXX
      *   XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  'G
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
                                                                       *
      *================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      *===============================================================
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.       IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.         LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT CPOLOG-TRG-FILE ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCS7300
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.


      *================================================================
       DATA DIVISION.
      *================================================================
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.
       01  CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPCS7300.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY FILESTATUS  OF COPYLIB.


       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-FLDS.
           03  WS-USER               PIC X(10)           VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-JOB                PIC X(10)           VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-JNBR               PIC X(06)           VALUE SPACE.
           03  WS-STATUS             PIC X(10)           VALUE SPACE.
               88  STATUS-IS-ACTIVE                VALUE "*ACTIVE".

      *============================================================
      *===              L I N K A G E    S E C T I O N
      *============================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-USER                   PIC X(10).
       01  LS-JOB                    PIC X(10).
       01  LS-JNBR                   PIC X(06).
       01  LS-MODE                   PIC X(01).

      *================================================================
      *===        P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N              ===
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LS-USER  LS-JOB  LS-JNBR LS-MODE.
       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  I-O    CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.

           EVALUATE TRUE

           WHEN LS-MODE = "1"
                PERFORM 1000-PROCESS-MODE-1   THRU 1000-M1-EXIT

           WHEN LS-MODE = "2"
                PERFORM 2000-SETUP-MODE-2     THRU 2000-SUM2-EXIT

           END-EVALUATE.

           CLOSE        CPOLOG-TRG-FILE.

       0000-PROGRAM-END.
           GOBACK.


      *****************************************************************
      ***  DELETE A USER/JOB/JNBR COMBO
      *****************************************************************
       1000-PROCESS-MODE-1.

           PERFORM 9000-READK-CPOLOG-TRG    THRU 9000-READK-EXIT.
           IF  FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               GO TO 1000-M1-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 9000-DELET-CPOLOG-TRG    THRU 9000-DELET-EXIT.

       1000-M1-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  PURGE  ALL NOT ACTIVE FOR A GIVEN USER
      *****************************************************************
       2000-SETUP-MODE-2.

           PERFORM 9100-START-CPOLOG-TRG THRU 9100-START-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2100-PROCESS-MODE-2   THRU 2100-M2-EXIT
                   UNTIL FS-END-OF-FILE.

       2000-SUM2-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      *** PURGE ALL NOT ACTIVE FOR A GIVEN USER
      *****************************************************************
       2100-PROCESS-MODE-2.

           PERFORM 9100-READN-CPOLOG-TRG    THRU 9100-READN-EXIT.
           IF  FS-END-OF-FILE
               GO TO 2100-M2-EXIT
           END-IF.

           CALL "CHKJOBSTS"  USING  WS-USER
                                    WS-JOB
                                    WS-JNBR
                                    WS-STATUS.

           IF  STATUS-IS-ACTIVE
               GO TO 2100-M2-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 9000-DELET-CPOLOG-TRG    THRU 9000-DELET-EXIT.

       2100-M2-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-READK-CPOLOG-TRG.

           INITIALIZE CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-USER          TO USER     OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-JOB           TO JOBNAME  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-JNBR          TO JNUMBER  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.

           READ CPOLOG-TRG-FILE
           END-READ.

       9000-READK-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  DELETE CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9000-DELET-CPOLOG-TRG.

           DELETE CPOLOG-TRG-FILE
           END-DELETE.

       9000-DELET-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  START  CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9100-START-CPOLOG-TRG.

           INITIALIZE CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LS-USER          TO USER     OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES       TO JOBNAME  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.
           MOVE  LOW-VALUES       TO JNUMBER  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC.

           START CPOLOG-TRG-FILE
                 KEY IS >= EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
           END-START.

       9100-START-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  READN  CPOLOG TRG FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9100-READN-CPOLOG-TRG.

           READ  CPOLOG-TRG-FILE  NEXT RECORD
           END-READ.

           IF  FS-END-OF-FILE
               GO TO 9100-READN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF  USER  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC NOT = LS-USER
               SET FS-END-OF-FILE    TO TRUE
               GO TO 9100-READN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE  USER     OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC TO WS-USER.
           MOVE  JOBNAME  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC TO WS-JOB.
           MOVE  JNUMBER  OF CPOLOG-TRG-REC TO WS-JNBR.

       9100-READN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***                  END OF SOURCE
      *****************************************************************
